  (b) the Build is free of charge, and You do not sell it, charge for access
      to it, bundle it with a paid product or service, or add advertising,
      paid features or payment collection of Your own to it;
  (c) the Build is not published or distributed through a Store;
  (d) the Account Functions are left intact. You may not remove, disable,
      bypass, redirect or replace them, point them at another service, or
